# Paths where a human approval is required regardless of the automated review.
#
# The reviewer approves ordinary PRs, but it must not be able to approve changes
# to the automation that governs it, or to the rules it reviews against. Anything
# that could weaken the gate — the workflows, the agent definitions, the review
# criteria, and the contracts — is owned by a human.
#
# Requires "Require review from Code Owners" on the branch rule. Note that
# docs/** is already contract-change territory per docs/WORKFLOW.md; the two
# entries below are the ones that also carry review policy.

/.github/workflows/       @bencan1a
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @bencan1a
/.github/rulesets/        @bencan1a
/.claude/agents/          @bencan1a
/.claude/settings.json    @bencan1a
/CLAUDE.md                @bencan1a
/REVIEW.md                @bencan1a
/docs/WORKFLOW.md         @bencan1a
/docs/CONTRACTS.md        @bencan1a
